  "_": [
    "Photography manifest for the Fanation prototype.",
    "",
    "Every id below is an Unsplash photo id that was probed against the CDN and",
    "confirmed to exist before it was written here, then looked at on a contact",
    "sheet before it was assigned. Nothing in this file is a guess.",
    "",
    "Rule R1 governs every pick: a photograph attributed to a named creator —",
    "post, reel, cover, profile grid, DM thumbnail or admin evidence — must not",
    "show a clearly identifiable face that is not that creator's. Identity is",
    "carried by the avatar, the name and the handle, exactly as TikTok and",
    "Instagram carry it on web. That is why the scene photography below is",
    "overwhelmingly hands, gear, backs of heads, rooms and objects.",
    "",
    "Four creators reuse their landing photograph so the marketing site and the",
    "app agree on the same face. The other five landing portraits are not",
    "reusable: creator-elena.jpg is a photograph of a man, creator-dembe.jpg and",
    "creator-nadia.jpg have no croppable face, and creator-aisha.jpg is already",
    "doing duty under three different names on landing."
  ],

